{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"英偉達即日起恢復黃仁勳行政總裁等職務\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/NVIDIA-WONG-261123-22.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】英偉達宣布恢復黃仁勳行政總裁等職務。</p><p>英偉達周一在官網公布，與黃仁勳進行連串會晤和討論後，決定即日起恢復黃仁勳行政總裁等職務，又稱董事會對黃仁勳的坦承以及領導公司的能力感到滿意。</p><p>英偉達又披露董事會聽取了美國政府高層意見，因此確信黃仁勳復職不會對國家安全構成任何風險。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:56:02.357233+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:19:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T01:37:12.051381+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T14:49:36.326429+00:00","content_hash":"ecd364d9b2cd6ca998befcd2b40df1071879e05bb3991de8e81a5a20c7ade3c5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T14:56:02.357233+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}